<title>USA: MAPCO opens Canadian subsidiary.</title>
<headline>MAPCO opens Canadian subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>MAPCO Inc said Wednesday it formed MAPCO Canada Energy Inc to pursue strategic business opportunities related to the production and transportation of natural gas liquids and petroleum products.</p>
<p>The MAPCO unit will be headquartered in Calgary, Alberta.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
